message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "AICP — The Agentic Web Operating System"
abstract: >
  AICP (AI Capability Protocol) is the protocol, runtime, memory, governance,
  perception, execution, and federation layer that turns the human web into an
  agent-operable web. It provides a layered operating system for autonomous AI
  agents with capability discovery, policy governance, workflow orchestration,
  multi-agent coordination, and federation across organizational boundaries.
